  "content": {
    "text": "3 days ago\nMagnificent Seven ETF falls as Amazon posts biggest loss among its holdings\nShares of an exchange-traded fund that invests in the Big Tech stocks known as the Magnificent Seven were in the red Friday afternoon.\nThe Roundhill Magnificent Seven ETF was down 0.4% as the fund’s holdings traded mixed. Amazon.com, Apple, Microsoft and Facebook parent Meta Platforms were all down, while shares of Tesla, Nvidia and Google parent Alphabet were rising. Amazon had the biggest loss among the seven stocks, with a sharp drop of 1.8%, according FactSet data, at last check.",
